  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development for Improved Employability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance formal employment and employability among vulnerable groups in pilot provinces T&#xfc;rkiye by implementing a comprehensive Applied Training Program (ATP) and complementary soft skills and language training. The ATP encourages regularization, providing both employers and workers with tangible benefits such as secure employment and access to a trained workforce. The project also addresses key barriers like language proficiency and technical skills through tailored training,</narrative>
  </description>
